WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
24 seconds flat, a clean rinse and they're done

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.280
And now it's Team India to the shower

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.340
Oh, but they're hesitating

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.420
No, no, no, it's too cold, I can't

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.300
Just go in, just go in

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.920
31 seconds and count
